          "en": "PROBLEM",
          "title": "射孔参数智能设计业务背景",
          "html": "<p>完井阶段确定孔密、相位与穿深，要兼顾穿透损害带、流动面积、出砂倾向与作业成本。将多目标问题压成一个固定分数会隐藏取舍。本例先在出砂教学约束内找出产能与成本的非支配前沿，再用用户选择的偏好选取一个候选。</p><figure class=\"figure\"><div style=\"overflow-x:auto\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"产能与成本非支配前沿，窄屏横向滚动\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 720 335\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"产能与成本非支配前沿\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;min-width:620px;max-width:860px;margin:auto\"><title>产能与成本非支配前沿</title><rect width=\"720\" height=\"335\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#f6f9f8\"/><g font-family=\"system-ui,sans-serif\" font-size=\"15\" fill=\"#334741\"><path d=\"M124 265H665\" stroke=\"#d8e1df\"/><text x=\"112\" y=\"270\" text-anchor=\"end\">-0.08</text><text x=\"124\" y=\"291\" text-anchor=\"middle\">28</text><path d=\"M124 211.25H665\" stroke=\"#d8e1df\"/><text x=\"112\" y=\"216.25\" text-anchor=\"end\">0.2</text><text x=\"259.25\" y=\"291\" text-anchor=\"middle\">49.2</text><path d=\"M124 157.5H665\" stroke=\"#d8e1df\"/><text x=\"112\" y=\"162.5\" text-anchor=\"end\">0.48</text><text x=\"394.5\" y=\"291\" text-anchor=\"middle\">70.4</text><path d=\"M124 103.75H665\" stroke=\"#d8e1df\"/><text x=\"112\" y=\"108.75\" text-anchor=\"end\">0.75</text><text x=\"529.75\" y=\"291\" text-anchor=\"middle\">91.6</text><path d=\"M124 50H665\" stroke=\"#d8e1df\"/><text x=\"112\" y=\"55\" text-anchor=\"end\">1.03</text><text x=\"665\" y=\"291\" text-anchor=\"middle\">112.8</text><circle cx=\"124\" cy=\"207.96607635135987\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#267d70\" fill-opacity=\".8\"/><circle cx=\"175.03773584905662\" cy=\"196.61224633124414\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#267d70\" fill-opacity=\".8\"/><circle cx=\"226.0754716981132\" cy=\"189.0015464694793\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#267d70\" fill-opacity=\".8\"/><circle cx=\"277.11320754716985\" cy=\"183.89994178777772\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#267d70\" fill-opacity=\".8\"/><circle cx=\"328.1509433962264\" cy=\"180.48023390268384\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#267d70\" fill-opacity=\".8\"/><circle cx=\"139.31132075471697\" cy=\"202.84882989182512\" r=\"3\